			"notes": "# The Reverse Update\nYou can now make carts go in reverse using the new Shuttle Ties block. Simply run a cart along a track ending in Shuttle Ties and the cart will roll backwards.\n## Other Changes\n- Brake tracks have been added that slow carts down smoothly. \n- Carts now snap to rails (if there are any) after leaving a Forkcart track. \n- All the mod's items now have their own item group.\n## Bugfixes\n- Fixed a typo in the translated name of the forkcart:track tag. (Trackx -> Track)\n- Removed unused fields from the track ties BlockEntityRenderer\n## Source changelog\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ImplicitSaber/Forkcart/compare/v1.21-1.0.0...v1.21-1.1.0"
		},
